## Local Preview
From this folder, run:

```text
npm start
```

Then open `http://127.0.0.1:4173/` in a browser.

For production, the website is deployed at https://jeremiah-collections.vercel.app/. Set the three Resend environment variables in the Vercel dashboard and redeploy to enable email. Add the production domain to Google Search Console and request sitemap indexing. Social media promotion and backlinks require the organisation's real profiles and partner outreach; no profile URLs or partner websites were supplied, so none have been invented.
